00:27:52,006 --> 00:27:54,687
[SPEAKER_04]: Not because you experienced it beforehand and then you learned about it.

379
00:27:55,981 --> 00:28:00,502
[SPEAKER_06]: So, the problem of Patrujana is, even when he thinks about death, he's putting himself first.

380
00:28:01,262 --> 00:28:05,663
