381
00:28:05,683 --> 00:28:07,783
[SPEAKER_06]: That point of view is first, death is second.

382
00:28:08,563 --> 00:28:22,046
[SPEAKER_06]: Now, you can learn about it theoretically in that way, but if you are transparent and you have practiced the right reasoning, you realize, right, but it's my very point of view that thinks about death that is already undermined by death.

383
00:28:23,099 --> 00:28:25,801
[SPEAKER_06]: And that's how you get to see the background that I talk about.

