390
00:29:06,201 --> 00:29:23,610
[SPEAKER_06]: Of that phenomenon, of that liability, the background liability that everything could end outside of my control, and nothing I do, conceive, infer, whatever else I revolve around, none of that can actually take me outside of that, as I said, enclosure.

