403
00:30:01,746 --> 00:30:03,086
[SPEAKER_06]: That's... it's the uncertainty.

404
00:30:03,527 --> 00:30:03,907
[SPEAKER_06]: That's it.

405
00:30:04,147 --> 00:30:09,032
[SPEAKER_03]: Those those eyes, that body, that's all uncertain, inaccessible to me.

406
00:30:09,613 --> 00:30:13,577
[SPEAKER_03]: So, I am enclosed to that disintegrating thing, that thing that's changing.

