435
00:32:28,628 --> 00:32:29,928
[SPEAKER_06]: That's the beginning of a samādhi.

436
00:32:30,489 --> 00:32:36,050
[SPEAKER_06]: It's not like concentration of sort of focusing on one point where the whole context, everything disappears.

