[SPEAKER_06]: Means the ultimate context of, like, uncertainty, death, stuff that you cannot possibly...

439
00:32:42,553 --> 00:32:45,315
[SPEAKER_06]: I mean, you can be not sure, but you cannot step outside of.

440
00:32:45,935 --> 00:32:49,077
